    question: 'Are noise-canceling headphones worth it for remote work?',
    answer: '<p>Absolutely. Noise-canceling headphones are one of the best investments for remote workers. They eliminate distractions from household noise, traffic, coffee shop chatter, and coworking space conversations—allowing you to focus deeply on your work.</p><p>Studies show that ambient noise significantly impacts cognitive performance and productivity. With ANC headphones, you can create a quiet workspace anywhere, whether you\'re at home, in a cafe, or on a plane.</p>'
